From 61144da7fb890177dea234ccd22f8ec97e49adba Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nick McMillen <153555205+nmcmil@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 02:58:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Settings: draft Network and Wi-Fi action compositions

Map network choices to FloatingMenu, network deletion to DestructiveDialog, and hidden-network and sharing flows to ActionCenter/ActionEditor. Compose the Network page from the C kit and bind hotspot text fields to the in-memory fixture. Add fixture-only connect/forget operations and negative tests. Use the exact v70 sample share artwork generated in the fixture; production QR encoding remains owned by the upstream network code. Runtime verification of this commit is pending: luma-dev-f44 entered a stopping state and refuses exec with operation not permitted. The previously exported 0029 build and tests passed before this environment failure. Remaining page and action integration is explicit draft work.
